==English==

===Etymology===
From {{term|un-}} + {{term|controllable}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-uncontrollable.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not able to be [[control]]led, [[contain]]ed or [[govern]]ed.
#: ''She got the '''uncontrollable''' urge for some chocolate.''

